* Task 17 regression fixture: DEFINE DATA with INDEPENDENT, CONTEXT, OBJECT sections
* Verifies that these extended section kinds are recognized and their fields are not silently dropped.
* Note: AIV names typically use + prefix (e.g. +AIV-NAME), but the lexer does not yet support +.
* This fixture uses regular identifiers in INDEPENDENT/CONTEXT sections to prove section recognition.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
1 #LOCAL-COUNTER (N5)
INDEPENDENT
1 #APP-STATE (A20)
CONTEXT
1 #RPC-SESSION (N7)
END-DEFINE

END
